config BR2_PACKAGE_CATALYST_UNITV
	bool "catalyst-unitv"
	help
	  What the shell installs on the smart camera (an M5Stack UnitV,
	  K210) over USB-A and the Grove port: Catalyst Coprocessor, a
	  MaixPy of Catalyst's own (MIT and Apache-2.0), Sipeed's YOLOv2
	  face model (MIT), the voice commands' keyword spotter (trained on
	  Speech Commands, CC-BY-4.0), kflash.py's K210 flash loader (MIT)
	  and Catalyst's main.py, in /usr/share/catalyst/unitv (2.4 MB),
	  each with its source and licence.

	  https://github.com/sipeed/MaixPy-v1
